res only for an unreachable primary (RETRY_NOW) or CHANGE_PROVIDER_OR_MODEL, and that a WAIT_AND_RETRY throttle retries the primary."},{"path":"docs/local-dev-env.md","reason":"Doc accuracy only: 'a fallback rescues availability failures only' now describes the pre-1c0d behavior; update to note a plain throttle/overload (WAIT_AND_RETRY) also does not fail over and retries the same primary."}]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"FILE_IMPACT","timestamp":1788048767144789101,"uuid":"3b24f5ff-ec16-4dea-99a0-7f0aec53bd81"}